[h2]Build 0.9.1[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Pneumatic tubes: compressed air tubes that link tube stations, built on Vanilla Expanded Framework's pipe network.
[*]Air compressor and air tank. The compressor idles while the tanks are full and runs at full power to refill them after each capsule is sent.
[*]Tube sender, pointed at one tube receiver, and two sizes of tube receiver (2 and 8 capsules).
[*]Packing bench with pack bills (full, half and tenth of a stack) and an unpack bill. Pack bills can be set to take their capsules straight to a tube sender, and "do until you have X" counts the goods at the destination.
[*]Capsule shells, made at a machining table or smithy and handed back when a capsule is unpacked.
[*]Capsules can be addressed to a sender, sent onward unopened, or marked for unpacking by selecting them.
[*]Alert when a sender has a capsule it cannot send.
[/list]
